schway-screen 1
screen stopped-tool
title Stopped command
description A stopped shell keeps the completed file write and offers explicit continuation without sending the next draft.
variant light-40
size 40x20
cursor 12 17 visible
== text
 ⚡ schway  ~/demo on main


  ✓  WRITE  saved.txt   new · 1 line
